<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="489970550"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1856773762"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Always in my heart"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="山田タマル"/><amll:meta key="album" value="TVアニメ『終末なにしてますか？忙しいですか？救ってもらっていいですか？』オリジナルサウンドトラック「青い記憶」"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:36.600"><div begin="00:17.530" end="03:36.600"><p begin="00:17.530" end="00:25.480" itunes:key="L1">The way if it's all predetermined<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果一切都已命中注定</span></p><p begin="00:25.480" end="00:33.260" itunes:key="L2">And the way i should go all my life<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我更应该认真过好我的一生</span></p><p begin="00:33.260" end="00:41.090" itunes:key="L3">I swear to go wherever will be<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不管遇到什么坎坷我都不会放弃</span></p><p begin="00:41.090" end="00:51.040" itunes:key="L4">'Cause there'll be something to see and to find<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为生活中总有不一样的风景等待着我们去发现</span></p><p begin="00:51.040" end="00:58.890" itunes:key="L5">I dont know the meaning of life<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然我不知道生命的含义是什么</span></p><p begin="00:58.890" end="01:06.870" itunes:key="L6">But i know what's truly precious<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是我知道什么最宝贵</span></p><p begin="01:06.870" end="01:14.780" itunes:key="L7">The way it's leading me to be in love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就是一直爱下去</span></p><p begin="01:14.780" end="01:23.500" itunes:key="L8">No fear i can find me always in my heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不畏惧一切艰难险阻 我总能坚持自己的内心</span></p><p begin="02:00.080" end="02:07.800" itunes:key="L9">The life it's not for comparing things<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">生命的意义不在于对比</span></p><p begin="02:07.800" end="02:15.830" itunes:key="L10">So i hold both of light and shadow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我珍惜光明 也享受黑夜带来的宁静</span></p><p begin="02:15.830" end="02:23.570" itunes:key="L11">The rays of stars will bring me to you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">闪烁的明星将我带到你身旁</span></p><p begin="02:23.570" end="02:27.360" itunes:key="L12">Throught the dark night skies<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿过黑夜</span></p><p begin="02:27.360" end="02:34.400" itunes:key="L13">See the way to be shined<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我看到了前方的路 一片光明</span></p><p begin="02:37.360" end="02:45.210" itunes:key="L14">I dont know what's right for our lives<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不知道生命中什么才是应该做的</span></p><p begin="02:45.210" end="02:52.040" itunes:key="L15">But i know the truth of my love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我知道什么才是真爱</span></p><p begin="02:52.040" end="03:01.120" itunes:key="L16">The way it feels our breaths at the wind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果一切都已命中注定</span></p><p begin="03:01.120" end="03:09.070" itunes:key="L17">And the way i should go all my life<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我更应该认真过好我的一生</span></p><p begin="03:09.070" end="03:16.810" itunes:key="L18">I swear to go wherever will be<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不管遇到什么坎坷我都不会放弃</span></p><p begin="03:16.810" end="03:20.650" itunes:key="L19">Thus the grace i wouldn't have<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">上天赐予的恩泽我一定铭记在心</span></p><p begin="03:20.650" end="03:24.780" itunes:key="L20">Will always in my heart</p><p begin="03:24.780" end="03:28.530" itunes:key="L21">Thus the grace i wouldn't have<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">上天赐予的恩泽我一定铭记在心</span></p><p begin="03:28.530" end="03:36.600" itunes:key="L22">Will always in my heart</p></div></body></tt>